9️⃣ Be Ready for Common Questions
Question Ideal Answer
Why did you choose PHP/MySQL? It’s easy to integrate, works well with XAMPP, and ideal for structured role-based apps.
How is data secured? Passwords are hashed; sessions manage access; role-based checks prevent unauthorized entry.
What’s the difference between doctor_id and user_id? user_id links to the main user account; doctor_id links to the doctor-specific info table.
What happens if I delete a doctor? The appointments linked to that doctor are also deleted due to foreign key constraints with ON DELETE CASCADE.
How can this be improved for real hospitals? Add a prescription, billing, and inventory management system.

